### u2lesson02-image07.tableau
### Long division: (12x^4 - 56x^3 + 59x^2 + 9x - 18) / (2x + 1). Solutions-only (Example 2b;
### textbook picks long division here even though the divisor is linear -- see the lesson's
### own note that synthetic division "can be used but long division may be easier" for ax - b).
